3.9435.05Unlike in Kate where the first set of signals are provided during the entire duration of activity tracking, as can be seen in reproduced Kate Fig. 4 above, in Applicant's case the native sensor data is not provided during the interval defined by the bracket (as can be seen in reproduced Applicant's FIG. 3B above), and therefore the pseudo sensor data is provided by the radio frequency (RF) based tracker 110.
